sequenceDiagram
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant SQS as SQS Queue
    participant DW as Discovery Worker
    participant P1W as Phase 1 Worker (x N)
    participant P2W as Phase 2 Worker (x N)
    participant K as Kafka
    participant DB as DTM Database

    Note over O,DB: Phase 1: Discovery

    O->>SQS: Dispatch DiscoverLineItems step
    SQS->>DW: DiscoverLineItems message
    DW->>DW: Query source DB for line item IDs
    DW->>O: Callback: SUCCESS + [itemId1, itemId2, itemId3]

    Note over O,DB: Phase 2: Fan-Out (child step creation)

    O->>DB: Set DiscoverLineItems → WAITING_FOR_CHILDREN
    O->>DB: Create ValidateLineItem + SubmitLineItem steps for each itemId
    O->>O: Delegate all ValidateLineItem steps (parallel)

    par For each itemId
        O->>SQS: Dispatch ValidateLineItem (itemId1)
        O->>SQS: Dispatch ValidateLineItem (itemId2)
        O->>SQS: Dispatch ValidateLineItem (itemId3)
    end

    Note over O,DB: Phase 3: Child Execution (parallel)

    par itemId1 flow
        SQS->>P1W: ValidateLineItem (itemId1)
        P1W->>O: Callback: SUCCESS + line item data
        O->>SQS: Dispatch SubmitLineItem (itemId1)
        SQS->>P2W: SubmitLineItem (itemId1)
        P2W->>O: Callback: SUCCESS + submitted data
        O->>K: Publish to lineItem.completed
        O->>DB: SubmitLineItem → WAITING_FOR_ACK
    end

    Note over O,DB: Phase 4: ACK + Aggregation

    K->>O: lineItem.ack (itemId1)
    O->>DB: SubmitLineItem (itemId1) → COMPLETED

    O->>O: Check: all children of DiscoverLineItems done?

    alt All children COMPLETED
        O->>DB: DiscoverLineItems → COMPLETED
    else Some children FAILED
        O->>DB: DiscoverLineItems → PARTIAL_SUCCESS
    end

    O->>O: continueJob() — check for more steps
